# Create .gitignore
New-Item -Path .gitignore -ItemType File
```

Open `.gitignore` with Notepad and paste this:
```
# Python
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual Environment
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Django
*.log
db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal
staticfiles/
media/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db